2x\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"980\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Abbaddon God Statue&quot; concept art 1.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/bf/%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg/105px-%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"105\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/bf/%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg/157px-%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/bf/%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg/209px-%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"754\" data-file-height=\"864\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:44px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Abbaddon God Statue&quot; concept art 2.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg/120px-%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"62\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg/180px-%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5b/%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg/240px-%22Abbaddon_God_Statue%22_concept_art_2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"530\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Abaddon Head&quot; concept art.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a2/%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg/104px-%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"104\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a2/%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg/156px-%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a2/%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg/209px-%22Abaddon_Head%22_concept_art.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"805\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Abbaddon Head Shot&quot; concept art.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/44/%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg/107px-%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/44/%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg/161px-%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/44/%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg/215px-%22Abbaddon_Head_Shot%22_concept_art.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"893\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"&quot;Bug Head&quot; concept art.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/c1/%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg/78px-%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"78\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c1/%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg/117px-%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c1/%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg/157px-%22Bug_Head%22_concept_art.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"980\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Abaddon has 12,240 <a href=\"/wiki/Health\" title=\"Health\">health</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Normal_mode\" title=\"Normal mode\">normal mode</a> and 13,200 health in <a href=\"/wiki/Hard_mode\" title=\"Hard mode\">hard mode</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Descriptions in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gw.dat\" title=\"Gw.dat\">gw.dat</a> imply that Abaddon's body was destroyed since throughout <i>Guild Wars Nightfall</i> he \"coalesces part of his godform\" as the event of Nightfall is brought about. This may explain why he is fought as a head and two arms.</li>\n<li>Abaddon's mask, sword and right gauntlet can be seen in the <a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Morah\" title=\"Ruins of Morah\">Ruins of Morah</a> mission.</li>\n<li>Abaddon's arms are actually separate models - his in-game model is just a head.</li>\n<li>The name \"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abaddon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Abaddon\">Abaddon</a>\" is the English form of the Hebrew word \"Avadon\" (אבדון), which translates to \"Doom\". In demonology, Abaddon was chief of the demons of the seventh hierarchy and was called The Destroyer.</li>\n<li>Abaddon is the largest <a href=\"/wiki/Foe\" title=\"Foe\">foe</a> in <i>Guild Wars</i>.</li>\n<li>Doing /dance in his arena will cause Abaddon to dance with you. Shortly after he will insta-kill the entire party.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Statue_of_Abaddon\" title=\"Statue of Abaddon\">Statue of Abaddon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon_Shrine\" title=\"Abaddon Shrine\">Abaddon Shrine</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: External links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"float: right; border: 1px solid #D16E5A; width: 250px; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 0.9em; background: #F9F9F9;\" cellspacing=\"3\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\"><img alt=\"Gw2logo.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/41px-Gw2logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/61px-Gw2logo.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b1/Gw2logo.png/81px-Gw2logo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"692\" data-file-height=\"479\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td>The <a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\">Guild Wars 2 Wiki</a>  has an article on <i><b><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Abaddon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Abaddon\">Abaddon</a></b></i>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"float: right; border: 1px solid #f6cd87; width: 250px; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; line-heig